This question tests knowledge of Belnap four-valued logic and the ability to construct a propagation/backtracking solver for inconsistent or incomplete rule sets, which is relevant to building robust policy engines.

## Key Concepts

- Belnap four-valued semantics and negation
- Implication defined as ¬A ∨ B in four-valued logic
- Constraint propagation to avoid definite false outcomes
- Backtracking search for satisfying assignments

